[StringTable.1]
Hold positions, prevent a breakthrough of the smelly line
[StringTable.2]
The enemy retreated, the task was completed.
[NewSubmission.Objectives]
Hold positions
[NewSubmission.Description]
Operational environment:
On the morning of July 11, after a powerful artillery preparation and bombardment, German troops attacked units of the 26th Guards. cn and 287 guards.vdsp. By introducing large forces of motorized infantry and tanks into battle, the SS managed to break through the defenses and capture the Oktyabrsky state farm. The enemy offensive is expected to continue with the aim of capturing Prokhorovka.
Enemy Forces:
Tanks and motorized infantry of the elite SS division "Leibstandarte Adolf Hitler". Up to 20 enemy tanks and self-propelled guns are expected to enter combat, including heavy Tiger tanks and Artshturm self-propelled guns, supported by motorized infantry on armored personnel carriers.
Combat mission:
Having taken command of the infantry of the 26th Guards Airborne Regiment and the artillery of the 7th Guards Airborne Artillery Regiment, repel the attacks of enemy tanks and infantry, preventing the capture of the Prokhorovka station. Please note that the Prokhorovka station area is vital and must be retained at all costs. Demand from your subordinates the unconditional implementation of the provisions of Order No. 227, remind them of the high rank of a paratrooper guardsman, which they carry with honor.

No step back! Death to the fascist invaders!

[NewSubmission.Success]
[NewSubmission.Failed]
